m pain.\n- **Psychological**: PHQ-9 score 16 (moderately severe depression). Reports feeling \'hopeless about pain ever getting better.\' Anxiety about ED visits — sometimes delays seeking care during crises because \'it is not worth the humiliation.\'\n- **PMH**: SCD (HbSS), AVN bilateral hips, chronic hemolytic anemia (baseline Hgb 7.0-7.5), iron overload (on deferasirox), cholelithiasis (pigmented stones).\n- **Medications**: Hydroxyurea 1500 mg daily, oxycodone 15 mg QID, deferasirox 20 mg/kg daily, folic acid 1 mg daily, ibuprofen 600 mg PRN (limited use — renal concerns).\n- **Social**: College junior, pre-med biology. Lives with roommate in campus housing. Parents supportive but live 3 hours away. Single. No substance use. Does not drink alcohol.',
